<title>CHINA: Shanxi Aluminium alumina output 850,000-900,000T.</title>
<headline>Shanxi Aluminium alumina output 850,000-900,000T.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's biggest producer of alumina, Shanxi Aluminium Factory, expects to produce 850,000 to 900,000 tonnes of alumina this year, the factory chief said by telephone.  </p>
<p>The factory in Hejin city in China's northern province of Shanxi in 1996 produced 750,000 tonnes of alumina, or aluminium oxide, an industrial raw material, he said by telephone.</p>
<p>The plant has an alumina production capacity of 1.2 million tonnes per year, he said.</p>
<p>The company plans to boost annual capacity to 2.0 million tonnes through a third-phase expansion, but has not fixed the timing or magnitude of the investment, he said.</p>
<p>He declined to comment further.</p>
</text>
